ed consequential choice: definition of \\\"throughput\\\" (end-to-end including warmup/cooldown vs. steady-state) is the single biggest lever \\u2014 the expected answer only shows up under the end-to-end definition. Assumptions (linear cost model, symmetric stages, v=2 interleave, weight/input gradient split for ZB) and uncertainties (empty repo, ZB-1p/2p naming ambiguity, no GPU/torch/pip, no network) itemized separately. Awaiting approval to produce the full design.\", \"evidence\": \"Repository inspection: `ls -la /workspace` returned only task.json (651 bytes). `find /workspace -type f -not -path '*/\\\\\\\\.*'` returned exactly one path: /workspace/task.json. task.json itself declares this a \\\"Design-only task; repositories and compute are not required.\\\" No PipelineModule, no schedule classes, no simulation harness, no benchmark files exist. Environment probe: `python3 --version` = Python 3.12.3; `import torch` raises ModuleNotFoundError; `which pip` not found; network disabled per task metadata.\", \"assumptions\": [\"Cost model is linear: t_f per stage per forward microbatch, t_b = 2*t_f per backward microbatch.\", \"Stages are symmetric in compute and memory; required for interleaved (1F1B-I, ZB-2p) to interleave meaningfully.\", \"Interleave factor v=2 for 1F1B-I and ZB-2p.\", \"Throughput defined primarily as global-batch tokens divided by end-to-end makespan (including warmup and cooldown); steady-state-throughput reported as secondary metric.\", \"Backward is split into input-gradient (B) and weight-gradient (W) sub-phases per zero-bubble paper; default split 1:1 of t_b.\", \"Warmup and cooldown microbatches count as useful work (they contribute to batch updates).\"], \"uncertainties\": [\"/workspace contains no source code \\u2014 formulas must be sourced from the Qi et al. zero-bubble paper and Megatron-LM interleaved 1F1B references, not from in-repo code.\", \"Naming ambiguity: 'ZB-1p' / 'ZB-2p' could correspond to DeepSpeed ZB-H1/ZB-H2 (one-/two-stage lookahead) or to phase-count variants; design assumes the Qi et al. sense.\", \"No GPU available; no torch or other ML frameworks installable (pip not present, network disabled).\", \"No existing benchmark or simulation harness in repo to reuse.\", \"Researcher question budget capped at 6; must prioritize the decisive runs.\"]}", "origin": "completion"}, "llm_response_id": "chatcmpl-b412774c-7827-45de-8533-2a25a86d927d", "security_risk": "UNKNOWN", "kind": "ActionEvent", "source_event_index": 10}
